%h3 Hi Action.IO Admin,

%p Please investigate why these boxes are dangling, help to fix/destroy the box and apologize to the owner, thanks!

%p Yours sincerely,
%p The Dangle Bot

%p
  %table
    %tr
      %th ID
      %th Name
      %th State
      %th Region
      %th Owner's Email
      %th Created At (UTC)

    - @dangling_boxes.each do |box|
      %tr
        %td= box.id
        %td= box.name
        %td= box.state
        %td= box.region.name
        %td= box.owner.email
        %td= box.created_at.strftime('%e %b %Y %H:%m:%S%p')

